(2) rho_E = (|0..0><0..0| + |b..b><b..b|)/2, |b> = cos(phi)|0> + sin(phi)|1> (hidden bit k not
    symmetric under the coupling): search over phi, theta, m <= 6 for the largest excess of
    I(rA:rB) over the conditionally-independent value at the same J_H.
